WEBVTT

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.730
Epidemic...?

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.770
The mumps virus.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.870
Formally known as epidemic parotitis.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:13.810
So...

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.190
Otherwise known as the mumps.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:20.950
She'll need one week's rest.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.140
What about school?

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:23.800
Can't go.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.400
Am I getting a shot?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.040
Yes, you are.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.960
Look, turn around now

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:36.300
but things like chances won't be there anymore.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.770
That's what some people will tell you,

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:47.020
but there are just times when you can't move at all.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:56.490
Yes, everything I say

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:00.950
is for your sake.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.450
Sorry, but

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.750
I won't consent easily

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.630
to things I don't accept.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:18.640
Even if I can get by that moment with a lie

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:21.720
I'll end up regretting it afterwards.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:24.520
Whether it's the past or the future

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.600
or, of course, the present,

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:31.020
I am the one that has to shoulder it.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:35.700
You'll understand the meaning to everything afterwards.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:34.320
So let's worry!

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.950
even if you don't understand them now,

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:44.620
whether it has to do with pain, fortune or secrets.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:49.000
So don't cry, let's hold each other as we go

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:52.500
forever-

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:58.260
It's My Life

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:58.260
because it's my life.

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:56.970
last frame of Manabi Straight! logo

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.190
Until Manabi-chan gets out of the hospital,

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:25.000
it'll be just me and Mei-chan working at the Student Council.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:34.080
Organize these, please.

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:41.730
Umm, I'm doing... all of these?

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.200
Nothing...

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:25.810
That reminds me...

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:31.490
I've never actually spoken with Mei-chan one-on-one before.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.350
I'll have a nice conversation with her...

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:42.210
...and eat dinner with her on the way home...

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.210
Here I go!

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:53.450
I'll be going.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.230
Ah... there's no way I can pull it off...

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:09.360
It's like, without Manabi-chan,
there's just nothing we can talk about.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.810
Am I thinking about this too much?

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.820
Hey, Mikan.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.820
Sorry, I have a softball prefectural tournament tomorrow.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:19.010
I don't really have time for this.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:21.170
But she's your friend, right?

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:25.820
Just bring up some random topic.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.400
Random, as in?

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:30.180
Like, TV shows you saw the night before.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.850
Mei-chan doesn't seem like she watches TV.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.680
Then, CDs you've listened to recently.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.560
She seems like the type that likes classical music,

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.730
and I don't know those.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:42.880
Then she'll probably make fun of me.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:46.310
If you need a helper, get Momo! Momo!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.340
I've tried that.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:00.410
You know Mei's that kind of a person.

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:03.060
All it takes, really, is for you to approach her.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:04.870
But!

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.390
She just joined the Student Council,

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:09.530
so she's feeling more insecure than you.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.090
Just be nice to her.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:13.260
But!!!

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:14.890
Nee-chan, time for dinner.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:17.170
I'm hanging up!

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:19.430
What's wrong with you?

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:20.680
Nothing.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.500
Gosh, that girl with no confidence.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.120
Let's go, dinner time.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.240
Mikan...

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:35.650
Hello?

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:02.440
Eh?

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:07.230
I'm sorry, but I have some personal business, so I can't come today.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.710
Ah, ah, I see.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:10.940
Bye.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:19.860
Are you guys closed now?

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:21.170
Did you ask her what her hobbies are, yet?

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.690
What do you guys talk about?

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.710
Did Etoh-san really make the CG for the School Fair?

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.190
Ah, I want to know, too!

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:28.400
U-Umm...

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.870
It was really great!

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.790
Honestly, isn't it tiring to be alone with her?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:36.250
Of course...

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:44.230
Of course?

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:46.430
...not.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.560
...she's feeling more insecure than you.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.070
Just be nice to her.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.360
I want to be treated nice, too.

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.360
Sorry.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.160
Ah, it's okay.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:08.350
Mail...

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.250
Oh yeah!

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:13.960
I may...

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:15.590
I may not be able to say it with my mouth,

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:18.080
but through mail, if there's something we can talk about,

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.170
I'll be able to get close to her!

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:21.130
I'll be able to become friends with her!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.140
I need to make the approach towards her!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.470
M-Mei-chan...

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.020
Umm, what a coincidence.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:34.930
Yeah.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:36.630
Do you come here often?

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:37.460
Never.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:38.530
I see!

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:40.090
Ahahaha...

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.160
Hahahaha!

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:46.150
Approach her, approach her!

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:46.700
Are you...

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.570
Are you going to write a letter?

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:51.210
Y-Yeah.

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:51.910
To whom?

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.000
U-Umm...

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:01.720
To Manabi-chan...

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:03.380
I see.

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:05.090
Same here.

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:07.340
Bye.

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:52.010
Mikan!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.030
It's morning!

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:54.120
Wake up!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.540
I don't want to go...

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:08.090
Gosh, you'll be late.

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:12.300
Mom, today, I...

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:13.730
Oh, yes, yes.

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:16.010
There's a letter for you.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.440
A letter?

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:21.520
It's not postmarked, so I think it was put directly in our box.

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:22.880
Here.

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:26.850
Today's breakfast is toast, okay?

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:27.890
You don't have much time, either.

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:33.110
I'll be going!

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:34.390
Wait, Mikan?!

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:37.350
After consulting Uehara-san over the phone,

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:40.790
she advised me to write a letter instead.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:42.810
So, I am writing a letter to you.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:47.740
I am not really good at speaking with people.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:53.010
But, it is not that I do not want any friends either.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.410
Although I'm not sure how to write this...

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:00.080
Ah, Mikan!

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.130
Why didn't you answer your phone last night...

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:05.460
Although I am not sure how to write this,

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:14.700
Inamori-san, you are nice and cheerful,

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:17.230
and I think it would be great if I could talk to you about various things.

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:21.170
Let's do our best in the Student Council, okay?

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:05.260
A group of people are worried about
the repercussions this has on the School Fair.

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:07.210
There's nothing to worry about.

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:10.860
Preparations for the School Fair have barely begun.

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.560
So, your absence has no effect?

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.850
There's still Mei-chan and Mikan-chan working at the Student Council,

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:17.940
so it'll be okay.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:18.670
Probably.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.660
By the way, Momo-chan...

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.410
Yes?

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:25.980
Where did you get that suit?

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:30.000
On the internet.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.210
A theme?

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:34.980
Yeah.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:37.320
During the previous General Assembly,

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:41.140
it became clear to me that you guys want
to create a School Fair-like atmosphere.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:44.530
But, without a more concrete plan as to what you're aiming for...

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.060
...or how the students are supposed to act...

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.110
If you don't give us guidelines,

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.410
it'll undoubtedly end up like last year,

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:51.900
where no one had a clue as to what was going on.

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:54.090
I see...

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:57.950
Ah, how about "exciting and wonderful"?

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:01.410
No... something a bit more...

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:06.130
In other words, something that can make the administration give approval to.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:11.360
There are some faculties that are very worried about the School Fair being run by the students.

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:13.010
Right?

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.170
Really?

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:21.430
Seioh is a school that has a long history
and places heavy emphasis on traditions.

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:26.400
It wouldn't be too surprising if there are teachers who are not pleased with how Amamiya-san is doing things.

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:29.820
That's so mean!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.780
Shimojii, you traitor!

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:34.420
Unforgivable!

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:38.280
I think Shimojima-sensei is serving as a bridge for us.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:43.900
That's why he wants us to come up with a theme that the naysayers can acknowledge.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.060
R-Really, Shimojii?

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:48.950
Well, anyway.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:50.630
Regardless of the situation,

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:53.100
I think you need a theme no matter what.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.850
It would serve as a guide for you guys, as well.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.520
I don't think it's a bad idea to think about it seriously at this point in time, okay?

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:05.170
Indeed.

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:07.980
Taking into account when Amamiya-san leaves the hospital,

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:09.800
well, if you have a week's time...

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.360
Yes, if we have that long to think about this...

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.360
Umm, Shimojii.

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.710
Can the two of us take care of this?

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:18.850
Uh, what?

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:20.780
Before...

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:28.910
Before Manabi-chan comes back,
can't the two of us come up with the theme?

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.970
Gosh, Sensei's so irresponsible.

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:44.880
Saying that he wants to hear what kind of theme the two of us can come up with...

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:48.740
All of you speak before you think.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.810
I don't.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:54.020
I really wanted the two of us to think about the theme.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:56.460
You and me, Mei-chan.

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:03.450
That's exactly what you call
'speaking before you think.'

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:07.120
Let's do our best, okay?

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:08.880
Mei-chan!

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:15.310
Yeah.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.430
Nothing good's coming to mind.

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:30.250
They're all okay for themes...

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:35.940
But why isn't anything good coming to mind?

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:37.660
Probably because...

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.370
...they're all nice but vague...

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:43.700
...and not exciting and dramatic...

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:44.870
That's right.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:52.170
Oh yeah!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.970
Come on! Come on!

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:59.130
We won't be able to win the tournament like that!

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:00.350
Final three laps!

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:01.340
Give it all you've-

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:05.860
So?

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.770
S-Something's coming ou-

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:10.930
Okay, then we're going for another lap!

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:23.880
Seioh!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.470
Fight-O! Fight-O!

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:32.610
Let's do this our own way.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.880
Seioh!

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.800
A-Agreed.

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:37.910
I swallowed it...

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.340
Good that you didn't throw up something disgusting.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.480
We're going to get into trouble, aren't we?

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:48.200
Don't worry, don't worry.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.570
Oh, well.

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.920
Damn, I'm hungry.

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:10.180
You've burnt it too much!

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:12.100
I'm making it crispy on purpose!

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.410
Thanks for the meal!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.350
I'm full, I'm full.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.320
Hey.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.220
You sure you don't need to call home?

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.810
Your family won't get worried?

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:43.500
Yeah.

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:50.590
Mei-chan.

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:55.810
You can see the stars better like this.

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:17.510
Good morning!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.520
Good morning!

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:32.700
Good morning!

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.330
Amamiya Manami has checked out of the hospital!

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.190
I asked everyone and they told me you guys are-

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:43.150
Oh my.

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:44.080
They're sleeping.

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:01.800
Huh?

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.620
Manabi-chan?

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.640
Umm, that document's-

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:14.660
This...

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:19.240
This is the best!

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:20.400
Don't hug me!!!

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:24.520
Just like how I became friends with Mei-chan,

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:27.730
and now I'm buddies with her,

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.010
I hope that through the School Fair...

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.910
...we can become buddies with more people.

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:36.740
With that thought...

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:47.550
Geez...

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:01.330
So sleepy.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:17.300
We're still at the very beginning of things.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.050
Even the thousand-mile road starts with a first step.

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:30.980
There's a first time for everyone,

00:22:31.190 --> 00:22:38.520
so take it on fearlessly - that's the best way to go

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:47.800
I'm glad I chose a path I love,

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:55.010
so thank you, God.

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:03.310
I want to treasure my luck right now

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.610
And stay happy on the way.

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:10.450
Come on, let's ride on the momentum

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:13.240
Bang！Bang！Bang！

00:23:13.300 --> 00:23:15.410
That's right, Lucky!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:19.000
Now is the time, happy!

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:22.130
Grab your chances

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:27.300
And live your lives to the fullest...
